sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant AG as Agent
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant W as Worker outbox (dashboard)
  participant N as Slack / SMTP
  AG->>DB: transaction : alerte + ligne outbox (pending)
  loop toutes les 3 secondes
    W->>DB: lignes pending dont next_attempt_at est passé
    W->>N: envoyer le message
    alt succès
      N-->>W: 200 OK
      W->>DB: status = sent
    else échec (ex. 503)
      N-->>W: erreur
      W->>DB: attempts + 1, last_error, next_attempt_at = +15 s, 30 s, 60 s, 120 s
    end
  end
  Note over W,DB: après 5 échecs : status = failed
